igned}\\int (2{sec}^{2}x-\\operatorname{sin}x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 2{sec}^{2}x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int \\operatorname{sin}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{tan}x-(-\\operatorname{cos}x)+C \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{tan}x+\\operatorname{cos}x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233636 :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "295e7322-51e3-57c4-a92b-99303a51ff13" :question/math-academy-id "q-2165" :question/problem "$\\int (\\operatorname{sec}x\\operatorname{tan}x-{sec}^{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sec}x\\operatorname{tan}x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sec}x+C, \\\\ \\int {sec}^{2}x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{tan}x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\operatorname{sec}x\\operatorname{tan}x-{sec}^{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{sec}x\\operatorname{tan}x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int {sec}^{2}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sec}x-\\operatorname{tan}x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250142 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a394ebb-e724-5257-b2b3-c6ee24c9c0ee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2sec⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247513} {:answer/id #uuid "645e7853-d773-51a7-97f0-145e363f5063" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2csc⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248330} {:answer/id #uuid "a159c48f-05f8-5b71-ac43-7e38b5032b08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248866} {:answer/id #uuid "cb0b4d51-0534-5643-95e4-f3c845c225d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249233} {:answer/id #uuid "ee2434c9-75b3-5a4f-85a5-13b29917e9e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2tan⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb