t⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479171} :answer-field/id #uuid "1ff1bc53-ef73-5ffd-96cf-06a499d26bdc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479164}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "dcbf6490-e6a9-56d2-a52b-fa7cdf372378" :question/problem "$\\int 7{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int {csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =-cot⁡\\theta +C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int 7{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  & =7\\int {csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =7(-cot⁡\\theta )+C \\\\  & =-7cot⁡\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Cosecant Squared"}]}
